    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253460/extras/2154f9d29339226e32bf40fb961ba383.avif?t=1729695815\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Escape from Box City</strong> is a lighthearted 3D platformer designed by a 7-year-old art director, offering a playful and creative adventure for all ages. The game takes place in a sprawling city made entirely of cardboard boxes, where players can choose from a variety of quirky, clay-animated characters to explore the world. The objective? To navigate through tunnels, leap across towering platforms, and find hidden items that will help you make your great escape from the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This kid-friendly adventure focuses on the fun of exploration and discovery without combat or violence. With a heavy emphasis on humor, imagination, and problem-solving, the game presents a colorful world full of surprises around every corner. It\u2019s perfect for younger players and families looking for a silly, engaging, and non-violent platforming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253460/extras/9b54b2c6bceb1bcaa562306638111408.avif?t=1729695815\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253460/extras/2154f9d29339226e32bf40fb961ba383.avif?t=1729695815\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><strong>Escape from Box City</strong> is a lighthearted 3D platformer designed by a 7-year-old art director, offering a playful and creative adventure for all ages. The game takes place in a sprawling city made entirely of cardboard boxes, where players can choose from a variety of quirky, clay-animated characters to explore the world. The objective? To navigate through tunnels, leap across towering platforms, and find hidden items that will help you make your great escape from the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This kid-friendly adventure focuses on the fun of exploration and discovery without combat or violence. With a heavy emphasis on humor, imagination, and problem-solving, the game presents a colorful world full of surprises around every corner. It\u2019s perfect for younger players and families looking for a silly, engaging, and non-violent platforming experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253460/extras/9b54b2c6bceb1bcaa562306638111408.avif?t=1729695815\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Escape from Box City is a playful 3D platformer designed by a 7 year old! Choose from quirky clay characters and explore a city made of cardboard boxes. Leap across platforms, navigate tunnels, and find hidden treasures in this silly, kid-friendly adventure focused on fun and exploration.",
